1
00:03:39,428 --> 00:03:45,428
Come together.

2
00:07:18,857 --> 00:07:24,857
Deadpool & Wolverine is a action, comedy, science
fiction film directed by Shawn Levy.

3
00:10:58,285 --> 00:11:04,285
A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as
the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him.

4
00:14:37,714 --> 00:14:43,714
But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must
reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.

5
00:18:17,142 --> 00:18:23,142
Wade Wilson / Deadpool / Nicepool, played by Ryan Reynolds.

6
00:21:56,571 --> 00:22:02,571
Logan / Wolverine, played by Hugh Jackman.

7
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:42,000
Cassandra Nova, played by Emma Corrin.

8
00:29:15,428 --> 00:29:21,428
Mr. Paradox, played by Matthew Macfadyen.

9
00:32:54,857 --> 00:33:00,857
Laura / X-23, played by Dafne Keen.

10
00:36:34,285 --> 00:36:40,285
Happy Hogan, played by Jon Favreau.

11
00:40:13,714 --> 00:40:19,714
Deadpool & Wolverine is a 2024 American superhero film based on Marvel
Comics featuring the characters Deadpool and Wolverine.

12
00:43:53,142 --> 00:43:59,142
Produced by Marvel Studios, Maximum Effort, and 21 Laps Entertainment, and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, it
is the 34th film in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) and the sequel to Deadpool (2016) and Deadpool 2 (2018).

13
00:47:32,571 --> 00:47:38,571
The film was directed by Shawn Levy from a screenplay he wrote with
Ryan Reynolds, Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick, and Zeb Wells.

14
00:51:12,000 --> 00:51:18,000
Reynolds and Hugh Jackman respectively star as Wade Wilson / Deadpool and Logan / Wolverine, alongside Emma
Corrin, Morena Baccarin, Rob Delaney, Leslie Uggams, Aaron Stanford, and Matthew Macfadyen.

15
00:54:51,428 --> 00:54:57,428
In the film, Deadpool works with a reluctant Wolverine from another universe to stop
the Time Variance Authority (TVA) from destroying his own universe.

16
00:58:30,857 --> 00:58:36,857
Development on a third Deadpool film began at 20th Century Fox by November 2016, but was
moved to Marvel Studios when Fox was acquired by Disney in March 2019.

17
01:02:10,285 --> 01:02:16,285
Wendy Molyneux and Lizzie Molyneux-Logelin joined in November 2020 as writers.

18
01:05:49,714 --> 01:05:55,714
Levy was hired to direct in March 2022, when Reese and Wernick
returned from the previous films for rewrites.

19
01:09:29,142 --> 01:09:35,142
The creative team had difficulty settling on a story until Jackman decided to reprise
his role as Wolverine from Fox's X-Men film series in August 2022.

20
01:13:08,571 --> 01:13:14,571
Several other actors from the X-Men films and other Marvel productions also returned as
part of a multiverse story, which serves as a tribute to Fox's Marvel films.

21
01:16:48,000 --> 01:16:54,000
Filming began in May 2023, taking place at Pinewood Studios, Bovingdon
Studios, and Norfolk in England as well as Los Angeles.

22
01:20:27,428 --> 01:20:33,428
Production was suspended in July due to the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike.

23
01:24:06,857 --> 01:24:12,857
Filming resumed in November and wrapped in January 2024.

24
01:27:46,285 --> 01:27:52,285
The title was revealed a month later.

25
01:31:25,714 --> 01:31:31,714
The film's soundtrack features an original score by Rob Simonsen and numerous
existing songs, including Madonna's "Like a Prayer" for key sequences.

26
01:35:05,142 --> 01:35:11,142
Deadpool & Wolverine is the first R-rated MCU film, retaining
that rating from the prior Deadpool films.

27
01:38:44,571 --> 01:38:50,571
Deadpool & Wolverine premiered on July 22, 2024, at the David H.

28
01:42:24,000 --> 01:42:30,000
Koch Theater in New York City, and was released in the United
States on July 26 as part of Phase Five of the MCU.

29
01:46:03,428 --> 01:46:09,428
Critics praised the performances of Reynolds and Jackman as well as the
humor, but were less positive about the film overall.

30
01:49:42,857 --> 01:49:48,857
It was a commercial success, grossing $1.338 billion worldwide and becoming the second-highest-grossing film of 2024, the
highest-grossing R-rated film ever, and the 20th-highest-grossing film ever at the time of its release.

31
01:53:22,285 --> 01:53:28,285
With a net production budget of $429 million, Deadpool & Wolverine is
believed to be one of the most expensive films ever made.

32
01:57:01,714 --> 01:57:07,714
It received various accolades.

33
02:00:41,142 --> 02:00:47,142
The film explores themes of hero, superhero, anti
hero, mutant, breaking the fourth wall.

34
02:04:20,571 --> 02:04:26,571
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
